{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/db787508f1ff1444965c629ddb3e04af.avif?t=1768272153\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flip through the pages of the iconic Trails series to where it all began with Trails in the Sky 1st Chapter!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This stunning, award-nominated remake reimagines the beloved classic with new breathtaking visuals, refined gameplay, and the first unforgettable adventure across Liberl Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Estelle Bright and her adoptive brother, Joshua, as they embark on their journey as junior bracers, determined to climb the ranks of their renowned peacekeeping guild. What begins as a straightforward mission to prove their worth quickly evolves into a gripping adventure of intrigue and peril, as they unravel a conspiracy that threatens the very heart of their homeland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 HIGHLY ACCLAIMED STORY AND CAPTIVATING WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in countless hours of adventure across Liberl as you progress through an elaborate storyline like no other. Every interaction is tailored to your unique progress in the game, from supporting characters all the way to NPCs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/cc8c3b401da04c0d4d94916f29931ea9.poster.avif?t=1768272153\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/cc8c3b401da04c0d4d94916f29931ea9.webm?t=1768272153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/cc8c3b401da04c0d4d94916f29931ea9.mp4?t=1768272153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 MODERN GAMEPLAY MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience seamless gameplay with the choice of traditional turn-based combat or all-new, real-time action combat, to suit your style of adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/45dbe5324e73dbaa5ded6a9ae991ee95.poster.avif?t=1768272153\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/45dbe5324e73dbaa5ded6a9ae991ee95.webm?t=1768272153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/45dbe5324e73dbaa5ded6a9ae991ee95.mp4?t=1768272153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 NEW VOICEOVERS IN ENGLISH AND JAPANESE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beloved characters come to life with brand new voiceovers in English and Japanese!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/ecb2a2a86c58e461c4f898eafe1cd7ac.poster.avif?t=1768272153\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/ecb2a2a86c58e461c4f898eafe1cd7ac.webm?t=1768272153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/ecb2a2a86c58e461c4f898eafe1cd7ac.mp4?t=1768272153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 ENHANCED HD VISUALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the stunning world of Liberl, brought to life with vivid high-definition detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the story that redefined the JRPG genre and set the Trails series on its legendary path!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hero of Liberl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375780/8ddd1be8cfdb16f73f263d9467ac91f77f1e6fce.jpg"},{"name":"Junior Bracer Trainee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375780/3f852a93ec04ef013f17a5a51d710308a93be052.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Bracer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375780/2cb8d8f00160d182c34fabfd4aa545697b8a9489.jpg"},{"name":"Promising Newcomer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375780/4ec5031776d304dde00e3170d0d44f7b785621fd.jpg"},{"name":"Quest Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375780/586ca48e9516aa5d54d64d038273bbc99596fa62.jpg"},{"name":"Battle Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375780/a0317b73e57b7d8fdc9737e5ad84e27e6915e73e.jpg"},{"name":"Three-Star Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375780/aca14c49fe85eb17fee5807dbbc6c24fedf53787.jpg"},{"name":"Peculiar Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375780/2f0b825deae840f800a7c6eb792c499486f88a90.jpg"},{"name":"Book Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375780/eca65938011673c8f256812b883ceee4bf37805b.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3375780/14d41b17358d6f08be9d5c0db62f50d18d7cf69d.jpg"}],"total":43},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3375780?t=1768272153","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768272153","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/74827d6ceab6ef1722b86eb1bfb49b879cb3c12d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768272153","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/74827d6ceab6ef1722b86eb1bfb49b879cb3c12d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768272153","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3902570,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/694ae3e0dd778e824efb9a3ba3cccf65.avif?t=1768272153\" width=1560 height=584 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure in style with the Trails in the Sky 1st Chapter Deluxe Edition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Deluxe Edition includes the following items:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trails in the Sky 1st Chapter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Season Pass</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/db787508f1ff1444965c629ddb3e04af.avif?t=1768272153\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flip through the pages of the iconic Trails series to where it all began with Trails in the Sky 1st Chapter!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This stunning, award-nominated remake reimagines the beloved classic with new breathtaking visuals, refined gameplay, and the first unforgettable adventure across Liberl Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Estelle Bright and her adoptive brother, Joshua, as they embark on their journey as junior bracers, determined to climb the ranks of their renowned peacekeeping guild. What begins as a straightforward mission to prove their worth quickly evolves into a gripping adventure of intrigue and peril, as they unravel a conspiracy that threatens the very heart of their homeland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 HIGHLY ACCLAIMED STORY AND CAPTIVATING WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in countless hours of adventure across Liberl as you progress through an elaborate storyline like no other. Every interaction is tailored to your unique progress in the game, from supporting characters all the way to NPCs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/cc8c3b401da04c0d4d94916f29931ea9.poster.avif?t=1768272153\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/cc8c3b401da04c0d4d94916f29931ea9.webm?t=1768272153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/cc8c3b401da04c0d4d94916f29931ea9.mp4?t=1768272153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 MODERN GAMEPLAY MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience seamless gameplay with the choice of traditional turn-based combat or all-new, real-time action combat, to suit your style of adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/extras/45dbe5324e73dbaa5ded6a9ae991ee9