","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Trails in the Sky 1st Chapter - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$59.99</span> $44.99 USD","packageid":1194552,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-25% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":4499},{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Trails in the Sky 1st Chapter - Deluxe Edition - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$79.99</span> $59.99 USD","packageid":1417625,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-25% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":5999}],"title":"Buy Trails in the Sky 1st Chapter"}],"packages":[1194552,1417625],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 33 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Settings: 1080p, 60 FPS, Performance Graphics Profile</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":25,"final":4499,"final_formatted":"$44.99 USD","initial":5999,"initial_formatted":"$59.99"},"publishers":["GungHo Online Entertainment America, Inc."],"ratings":{"cero":{"descriptors":"\u30bb\u30af\u30b7\u30e3\u30eb\u3001\u604b\u611b\u3001\u66b4\u529b\u3001\u72af\u7f6a","rating":"b","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"true"},"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogas l\u00edcitas\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria\nAtos criminosos","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Alkohol / Tabak\nGewalt\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"recommendations":{"total":3361},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"19 Sep, 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cTrails 1st is the type of RPG I can definitively point towards and say \u201cThis is a must play.\u201d It\u2019s up there with Dragon Quest XI as a fantastic entry into RPGs for newcomers, as well as a master-class in RPG design for genre veterans. The world, the characters, the progression \u2014 everything just flows extremely well.\u201d<br>RPG Site<br><br>\u201cTrails in the Sky 1st Chapter is the definitive way to start the Trails series. It is an amazing game, and the story and themes are just as relevant today as they were 20 years ago.\u201d<br>The Outerhaven<br><br>\u201cTrails in the Sky 1st Chapter, despite being a remake of a 21 year old game, feels like a breath of fresh air. It masterfully combines action and turn-based combat using some in-depth character customization and weaves an intricate tale of love, empathy, political strife, and redemption. It\u2019s a game that is almost always firing on all cylinders, keeping you engaged on this road and those beyond.\u201d<br>GamingTrend<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/a9da5f1c44b464bb54b6b2c391227d7c7fab0eba/ss_a9da5f1c44b464bb54b6b2c391227d7c7fab0eba.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768272153","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/a9da5f1c44b464bb54b6b2c391227d7c7fab0eba/ss_a9da5f1c44b464bb54b6b2c391227d7c7fab0eba.600x338.jpg?t=1768272153"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375780/afdf39824c6d220281a2f300b309e70b89757b22/ss_afdf39824c6d220281a2f300b309e70b89757b22.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768272153","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.s